  m_Name: ArcadeGameStandoff
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 125
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Standoff
  Description: 'Grizzlies only - square posts of prisms stand round an open centre, cover to dig in
    behind. Fire a trigger bomb at a rival - it flies through the posts, and when it touches
    their hull it sticks. Pull and release again to blow it. Every rival a blast of yours
    catches is a point that silences them. Dig in behind a post to aim and recharge, and
    charge the cannon for a bigger blast. Higher intensities add posts, an inner ring,
    shielded rims and danger corners. First team to the target wins.'
